          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli tiyaboine Shauli rundi kuhika kir'ekyo yafire. Kyonkai amujunalira muno. N'Omukama ayefuhya ekyo yateleireho Shauli kuba mukama wa Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
